ebhookURL\" )\n\n🛑 Optional: You can customize the webhook however you like\n\n‖⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐‖  🔽 About 🔽 ‖⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐‖\n\n📌 Made by Cilvania (ME)\n📌 Take NOTE that this isn't an IP LOGGER, This doesn't have any malicious use as it only sends ROBLOX PROFILE information - It only logs the information on Discord following:\n\n‖⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐‖ 🔽 Logs Information 🔽 ‖⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐⁐‖\n\n🔘 Roblox Username\n🔘 Roblox Profile Image\n🔘 Roblox Membership Type (Premium - False)\n🔘 Roblox Alt Identifier (ALT - False)\n🔘 Roblox Account Age (Days)\n🔘 Roblox Executor Detector \n🔘 Roblox Game Link and Name","tags":["discord","webhook","misc","roblox","universal script"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"63366e9cbce220b8df492749","username":"Cilvania","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/63366e9cbce220b8df492749-1664512204230.png"},"status":"offline","id":"63366e9cbce220b8df492749","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/63366e9cbce220b8df492749-1664512204230.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T18:15:58.488Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4ba86","editBy":{"_id":"63366e9cbce220b8df492749","username":"Cilvania","status":"offline","id":"63366e9cbce220b8df492749"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2022-10-14T06:43:06.635Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4ea0f","editBy":{"_id":"63366e9cbce220b8df492749","username":"Cilvania","status":"offline","id":"63366e9cbce220b8df492749"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T12:57:45.849Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6348de89549755f6b909fc1d","commentBy":{"_id":"628d7f7fa30903ff69051f6e","username":"SmoxHub","verified":false,"role":"user","profileP